    "source": "\n**Frame:** Timestamp `22:43 UTC`. One connector returns a catalog of many cluster destinations to an ephemeral client. The catalog is represented by sealed cards.\n\n**Action:** An overbroad service identity spans boundaries that should have been separate.\n\n**Caption:**\n> ONE SHARED TRUST RELATIONSHIP CROSSES MANY CLUSTERS.\n\n**Provenance:** `documented` + `inferred` — connector behavior and shared authority are sourced; trust-language is architectural synthesis.\n\n",
